Browser Game Runtime

Extracted and generalized from DOOM Classic Browser:
https://github.com/adhenawer/Doom-classic-browser

The verified streaming reader derives from web/loading.ts. Source-aware action
state derives from web/input.ts. Local storage derives from web/storage.ts; the offline worker generator derives
from scripts/offline.mjs. All retain GPL-2.0-or-later licensing.
